{
  "segments": [
    {
      "end": 8,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "start": 0,
      "text": "Perfect. You just look around this mosque anytime. Even the one person who came with one leg.",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "end": 18,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "start": 8,
      "text": "Remember what was his name? He healed, Felix. He left with two legs. So that designed the creation.",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "end": 25,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "start": 18,
      "text": "And the creation of the heavens and the earth are enough signs for God. Now after they chop the carrots, where will they go?",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "end": 27,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "start": 25,
      "text": "They go to grinders.",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "end": 31,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "start": 27,
      "text": "You see how they design the grinders? They're flat.",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "end": 35,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "start": 31,
      "text": "The front teeth designed like scissors.",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "end": 40,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "start": 35,
      "text": "They go just like scissors. They cut.",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "end": 45,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "start": 40,
      "text": "Then they go to the grinders to make it fine. Then you swallow.",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "end": 50,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "start": 45,
      "text": "Now in the swallowing process here you take it for granted, don't you?",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "end": 54,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "start": 50,
      "text": "But when you swallow, the air pipe is blocked.",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "end": 61,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "start": 54,
      "text": "You see the movement in there, there's a ceiling of the air pipe so the food will go to the stomach, not to the lungs.",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "end": 64,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "start": 61,
      "text": "You take this for granted, don't you?",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "end": 67,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "start": 64,
      "text": "With God's desire, and you don't control it.",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "end": 73,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "start": 67,
      "text": "And this is what it means, that everything in the heavens and the earth glorifies God.",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "end": 76,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "start": 73,
      "text": "Because even the disbeliever glorifies God.",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "end": 81,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "start": 76,
      "text": "Because when the disbeliever swallows, his system is working according to God's will.",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "end": 91,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "start": 81,
      "text": "The wind, the air pipe is blocked and the digestive tract is opened.",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "end": 96,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "start": 91,
      "text": "That this believer's heart bumps and he has no control over it.",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "end": 100,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "start": 96,
      "text": "Can you stop your heart for a second?",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "end": 106,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "start": 100,
      "text": "Can you slow it down or make it faster?",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "end": 108,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "start": 106,
      "text": "So this is what it means.",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "end": 112.64,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "start": 108,
      "text": "the heavens and the earth glorifies God. So in the creation of the heavens and the earth,",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "end": 121.8,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "start": 112.64,
      "text": "I can go on and on as you see. The alternation of light and day. One of my favorite subjects.",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "end": 128.56,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "start": 121.8,
      "text": "You saw the picture of the earth today. And the spaceship happened to be between the sun",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "end": 134.48,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "start": 128.56,
      "text": "and the earth. So they took a picture of the illuminated side. The deviated illuminated",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "end": 144.12,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "start": 134.48,
      "text": "side of it. And the other side was night. Now the earth is turning and there's alteration",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "end": 151.36,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "start": 144.12,
      "text": "of light in there because it implies the earth is hanging in space. Who is holding it in",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "end": 158.24,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "start": 151.36,
      "text": "space? Now how can the people avoid believing in God when they think about this? This what",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "end": 167.52,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "start": 158.24,
      "text": "needs overwhelming signs of that. The axis of the earth is designed to create the seasons",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "end": 180.52,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "start": 167.52,
      "text": "which controls what kind of plants we grow, what kind of crops, what kind of food. What",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "end": 187.36,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "start": 180.52,
      "text": "else is far as the... Now the speed of rotation of the earth controls how many hours will",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "end": 194.2,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "start": 187.36,
      "text": "have them today. I mean they are nice and the speech is accurate. We know exactly what",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "end": 200.2,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "start": 194.2,
      "text": "time the sun will rise through a hundred years from now. And it's so accurate they could",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "end": 205.84,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "start": 200.2,
      "text": "predict where another planet was. I think they'll never see. Like a discovery of Neptune.",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "end": 209.92000000000002,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "start": 205.84,
      "text": "They had never seen Neptune with the mathematical laws. So precise they turn their telescope",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "end": 215.52,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "start": 209.92000000000002,
      "text": "where they calculate and where it was. That's how accurate they are.",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "end": 217.2,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "start": 215.52,
      "text": "Now they do it by the solar system.",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "end": 219.36,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "start": 217.2,
      "text": "Now they do it by the laser beam bouncing back.",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "end": 224.07999999999998,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "start": 219.36,
      "text": "All power that's in the solar system is one second slower or one second faster",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "end": 225.68,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "start": 224.07999999999998,
      "text": "will be on it by the way.",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "end": 230.24,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "start": 225.68,
      "text": "This reminds me that the latest distance they measure was four billion light",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "end": 232.56,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "start": 230.24,
      "text": "years.",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "end": 238.8,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "start": 232.56,
      "text": "They saw an object that is four billion light years away.",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "end": 243.48,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "start": 238.8,
      "text": "which means if that object was destroyed, died,",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "end": 247.14,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "start": 243.48,
      "text": "four billion years ago, we'll still see the light coming.",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "end": 253.4,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "start": 247.14,
      "text": "Now four billion light years,",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "end": 255.08,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "start": 253.4,
      "text": "you know, you're traveling at the speed of light",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "end": 259.2,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "start": 255.08,
      "text": "for 4,000 million years to get there.",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "end": 262,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "start": 259.2,
      "text": "And that's within the small universe.",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "end": 273.1,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "start": 267.56,
      "text": "So the alternation of night and day implies a lot of information that tells us how great",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "end": 276.74,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "start": 273.1,
      "text": "God is.",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "end": 283.02,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "start": 276.74,
      "text": "The ships that roam the sea for the benefit of mankind.",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "end": 292.86,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "start": 283.02,
      "text": "Water is a crazy liquid that has the physicist's puzzle because things float, things float",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "end": 301.5,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "start": 292.86,
      "text": "water, not an alcohol or kerosene or water has crazy properties.",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "end": 306.46,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "start": 301.5,
      "text": "University of California, I took that course and the University of California, the fact",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "end": 309.46,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "start": 306.46,
      "text": "that it is water.",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "end": 314.74,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "start": 309.46,
      "text": "It has the physics, physical chemistry and chemistry of water because it's unique.",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "end": 323.38,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "start": 314.74,
      "text": "of gutter that makes the ships float and the water makes you float and the water. Unless",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "end": 332.78,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "start": 323.38,
      "text": "you do something to drown, you stand still you float and the water. Also, we exit evaporate",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "end": 338.5,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "start": 332.78,
      "text": "and then go to a certain height and hang up there. See, the clouds come up, coming up.",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "end": 344.06,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "start": 338.5,
      "text": "The clouds hanging between the earth and the sky.",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "end": 349.22,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "start": 344.06,
      "text": "So they cool down and condense again into pure water.",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "end": 356.98,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "start": 349.22,
      "text": "All these are designs.",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "end": 363.62,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "start": 356.98,
      "text": "The water of God sends down to revive dead lands.",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "end": 367.7,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "start": 363.62,
      "text": "I was just talking today about desert plants.",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "end": 373.7,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "start": 367.7,
      "text": "For example, do you know that the seeds of desert plants will not germinate unless a specific",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "end": 377.42,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "start": 373.7,
      "text": "amount of rain falls?",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "end": 383.9,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "start": 377.42,
      "text": "The mechanism of it is there is an inhibitor around the seeds that is water solid.",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "end": 387.5,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "start": 383.9,
      "text": "And you have to have a certain amount of water fall on it and wash the inhibitor away.",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "end": 391.78,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "start": 387.5,
      "text": "So this guarantees a reservoir of water for the plant, for the seed.",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "end": 397.62,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "start": 391.78,
      "text": "The seed will not germinate unless a specific amount of water falls.",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "end": 410.1,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "start": 397.62,
      "text": "doesn't. Who designed all this? But if the person makes a decision that they don't believe",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "end": 417.74,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "start": 410.1,
      "text": "in God, they will not see any of this, as we know from the Quran. The manipulation of",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "end": 427.66,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "start": 417.74,
      "text": "the winds. If the wind was stand still for three or four months the whole life life will end.",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "end": 433.66,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "start": 427.66,
      "text": "We need the wind because you know where all the water coming from or these clouds",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "end": 442.94,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "start": 433.66,
      "text": "come from the Pacific coast or the Atlantic because it's driven by the wind otherwise we",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "end": 448.82,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "start": 442.94,
      "text": "wouldn't be here. There'd be no water in the underground. And you know how they panic",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "end": 456.26,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "start": 448.82,
      "text": "and Tucson when the rain is laid or something and they have all those beat the peak programs",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "end": 466.5,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "start": 456.26,
      "text": "they panic. So you can imagine if there's no wind there'll be no Tucson. The manipulation",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "end": 476.02,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "start": 466.5,
      "text": "of the wind. But, they are not even agosta, wouldn't it start to become good. The clouds",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "end": 482.66,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "start": 476.02,
      "text": "blast between the heavens and the earth, all these are signs for people who understand.",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "end": 490.5,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "start": 482.66,
      "text": "Now the idol was supposed to be disowned by the idols, 165. Yet some people set up idols",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "end": 497.5,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "start": 490.5,
      "text": "besides God and as ordered as if they were God.",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "end": 502.1,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "start": 497.5,
      "text": "However, the believers love God more than anything else.",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "end": 507.3,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "start": 502.1,
      "text": "If only the wrongdoers could envision themselves when they face the retribution,",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "end": 511.3,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "start": 507.3,
      "text": "they will find out that all power belongs to God alone,",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "end": 515.3,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "start": 511.3,
      "text": "and that God is very strict and imposing retribution.",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "end": 518.9,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "start": 515.3,
      "text": "Those who were followed will disarm their followers.",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "end": 522.9,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "start": 518.9,
      "text": "They will suffer the retribution and all head to them will be severed.",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "end": 528.4,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "start": 522.9,
      "text": "The followers will then say, \"If we could live our first life again,",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "end": 531.6,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "start": 528.4,
      "text": "we will then disown them as they disown us now.\"",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "end": 538.3,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "start": 531.6,
      "text": "Thus, will God show them the consequences of their works as nothing but sorrow.",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "end": 540.9,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "start": 538.3,
      "text": "They will never exit from hell.",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "end": 562.1,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "start": 546.9,
      "text": "Now, this verses are actually written in the past tense in the Arabic.",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "end": 566.5,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "start": 562.1,
      "text": "So I guess in the next edition I will make this in the past tense.",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "end": 572.66,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "start": 566.5,
      "text": "And they were in the past tense because God is telling us something that actually took place in our future.",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "end": 577.42,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "start": 572.66,
      "text": "God witnessed it and He's telling us what happened between the idols and the idol-orship",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "end": 580.9,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "start": 577.42,
      "text": "was.",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "end": 586.94,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "start": 580.9,
      "text": "And we saw today the insignificance of the idols, whether it is Muhammad or Jesus or",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "end": 597.94,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "start": 586.94,
      "text": "Mary or St. Francis or whatever, the things that the people idolized.",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "end": 603.34,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "start": 597.94,
      "text": "The newspaper actually has prayers to Sam Jew for certain things.",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "end": 606.64,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "start": 603.34,
      "text": "Today, I mean in the newspapers on this day.",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "end": 607.24,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "start": 606.64,
      "text": "No, why?",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "end": 607.64,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "start": 607.24,
      "text": "Huh?",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "end": 608.84,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "start": 607.64,
      "text": "And that's very technical view.",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "end": 612.04,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "start": 608.84,
      "text": "Yeah, in the personhood?",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "end": 617.34,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "start": 612.04,
      "text": "Two days ago, this lady wrote to Anne Landers saying that she made a mistake investing her",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "end": 620.14,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "start": 617.34,
      "text": "mother's life savings.",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "end": 623.14,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "start": 620.14,
      "text": "And she was paying to marry and...",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "end": 634.08,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "start": 627.84,
      "text": "and the title was \"The Virgin and the Ten Jews Will Not Help You\". That was the title for",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "end": 637.52,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "start": 634.08,
      "text": "\"The Hand-Namels\".",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "end": 643.8,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "start": 637.52,
      "text": "Now, so we saw today the insignificance of the idols. We saw the picture of theirs and",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "end": 652.88,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "start": 643.8,
      "text": "how big those people were, Muhammad or Mary or Jesus. Now we have to imagine that they",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "end": 659.14,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "start": 652.88,
      "text": "of judgment because that day will come and the people who run to Jesus for example and",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "end": 666.26,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "start": 659.14,
      "text": "tell him are you going to help us and he will say what you're talking about I need help",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "end": 674.64,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "start": 666.26,
      "text": "myself because he will be subject to the Zatran, just like all of us.",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "end": 680.36,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "start": 674.64,
      "text": "As a matter of fact all of us will go we'll see helpers initially so that we appreciate",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "end": 687.94,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "start": 680.36,
      "text": "heaven and Shah Allahu will get there. But we must imagine that what these verses are",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "end": 692.86,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "start": 687.94,
      "text": "telling us that the people who go to their idols, they will go to Muhammad. You heard",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "end": 699.02,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "start": 692.86,
      "text": "about the mess of intercession of Muhammad. They will go on, we do not see it on our behalf.",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "end": 704.02,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "start": 699.02,
      "text": "And he is going to tell them, sorry, I have no power. I am worried about my own neck,",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "end": 712.14,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "start": 704.02,
      "text": "So right when he tells us that the prophets will be worried about their own faith.",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "end": 714.42,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "start": 712.14,
      "text": "This what these verses are telling us.",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "end": 721.26,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "start": 714.42,
      "text": "This what the Bible is saying in Matthew 723, you want to see it, Matthew 723 says that",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "end": 725.38,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "start": 721.26,
      "text": "the people who go to Jesus and that they have judgment and tell him, \"Lord, Lord, have we",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "end": 727.14,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "start": 725.38,
      "text": "not prophesied in your name?",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "end": 729.54,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "start": 727.14,
      "text": "Have we not performed miracles in your name?",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "end": 731.54,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "start": 729.54,
      "text": "Have we not glorified your name?\"",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "end": 735.54,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "start": 731.54,
      "text": "And Jesus will say, \"Away out of my sight, I don't know you.\"",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "end": 738.54,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "start": 735.54,
      "text": "So that was he with his own den.",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "end": 744.14,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "start": 738.54,
      "text": "He just listened to the pictures on the TV and the radio and see how much glory and",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "end": 746.14,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "start": 744.14,
      "text": "justice he's used to have done.",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "end": 752.14,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "start": 746.14,
      "text": "So Satan succeeded in diverting their attention from God to Jesus.",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "end": 758.14,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "start": 752.14,
      "text": "And Satan did the same trick with the Muslims, by diverting their attention from God to Muhammad.",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "end": 766.86,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "start": 758.14,
      "text": "The road-driven beings and the old subject to the two-sentence tricks.",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "end": 775.94,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "start": 766.86,
      "text": "So these verses here are telling us that the idols will disown the worshippers.",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "end": 777.46,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "start": 775.94,
      "text": "These verses are actually identical.",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "end": 779.7,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "start": 777.46,
      "text": "(buzzing)",
      "words": []
    }
  ]
}